Owner-review patch (audit finding #6). Agents cannot edit atm/risk/limits.py (PreToolUse hook),
so this fix is proposed for the owner to apply:   git apply docs/owner_patches/0001-risk-limits-reject-nan.patch
Effect: only makes validation stricter — NaN/inf/non-numeric/bool-typed values are rejected.
Before: `max_drawdown_pct: .nan` in YAML passed every comparison and disabled the drawdown kill.

--- a/atm/risk/limits.py
+++ b/atm/risk/limits.py
